# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  UniversalPOS — .gitignore
#  Controls exactly what goes to GitHub vs stays local.
#
#  STRATEGY:
#    README-github.md  → the ONLY readme that goes to GitHub
#                        (rename it to README.md on GitHub manually)
#    README.md         → local working doc — NEVER pushed
#    README-personal.md → local working doc — NEVER pushed
#    PROJECT.md        → local architecture notes — NEVER pushed
#    token.txt         → if you save a JWT token to a file locally
#
#  APPLICATION SECRETS → NEVER pushed (DB password, JWT secret, etc.)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── README strategy ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Only README-github.md goes to GitHub.
# The others are private working documents.
README.md
README-personal.md
PROJECT.md

# ── JWT token file (if you save a token locally for testing) ─
token.txt
*.token

# ── Application secrets — CRITICAL: NEVER push these ────────
# These files contain your database password, email password,
# and JWT signing secret. One accidental push = everyone can
# read your credentials and log into your system.
pos-api/src/main/resources/application.yml
pos-api/src/main/resources/application-local.yml

# ── Maven build output ───────────────────────────────────────
# "target/" is generated by Maven — never commit it.
# It can always be rebuilt with: mvn clean install
target/
*.class
*.jar

# ── IDE / editor files ───────────────────────────────────────
# Personal editor settings differ per developer.
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log

# ── Generated PDF receipts ───────────────────────────────────
# PDFs are generated at runtime — no need to track them.
receipts/

# ── OS system files ──────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  WHAT DOES GO TO GITHUB (everything not listed above):
#
#  ✅ README-github.md    ← your public README (rename to README.md on GitHub)
#  ✅ All Java source     ← src/ directories
#  ✅ pom.xml files       ← build configuration
#  ✅ Flyway migrations   ← db/migration/*.sql
#  ✅ Email templates     ← templates/
#  ✅ docker-compose.yml  ← so others can run the project
#  ✅ scripts/            ← login.sh and login.bat helpers
#  ✅ .mvn/jvm.config     ← needed for Lombok to compile on Java 21+
#  ✅ .gitignore          ← this file
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
